This product is a derivative work forked and refactored from GABRIEL
(https://github.com/openai/GABRIEL), originally developed by OpenAI.

Summary of major modifications in Leximeter:
- Scoped to text-only measurement workflows (removed image/audio/PDF multimodal paths).
- Replaced the monolithic OpenAI client/orchestration module with a provider-neutral
  client protocol layer (src/leximeter/client/) and generic execution engine
  (src/leximeter/engine/).
- Added pluggable embedding providers (local BGE / OpenAI-compatible) and pluggable
  web search (Tavily).
- Added shared Task / AttributeTask base classes and task-level checkpoint/resume.
- Adapted select prompt templates in src/leximeter/prompts/ for text-only and
  provider-neutral usage (marked individually).

